	real fights, the Night, family under pressure and a sibling in trouble.
	More teen life: Teens_City.luau (Fixers, Wings, Syndicates, Districts, origins),
	Teens_Nest.luau (the clean side), Teens_Styles.luau (finding a fighting style).
	Follow-ups at 18-22 live in Teens_Arcs.luau.
		Ferro & Daughter   tn_w_ferro -> tn_w_wrapped_blade, tn_w_ferro_patent -> tn_a_ferro_bench
		Lamp Street route  tn_w_kostya -> tn_w_double_booked, tn_w_underpass_toll -> tn_a_kostya_trunk
